	)
	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE L1:\nQ1/Q2 DPAK: >= 300 mm^2 L1 pour on each collector tab (D6; up to 1.1 W in a 10 mA fault), 1.5 mm to everything; no thermal vias into L2."
