	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D2:\nBias string and Darlington followers (D-05): PUMP_V+ / PUMP_V- float with PUMP_OUT; the INA149 needs >= 4.5 V across them. Compliance 5 mA into >= 13.1 kOhm at a 90 V rail [N]."
